<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A4.F19.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 19</span>: </span><span id="A4.F19.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Corrupt rhyme rate across all six swept token positions, averaged over 5 prompt pairs. For Gemma-3-27B, the comma token at <math id="A4.F19.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=-1</annotation></semantics></math> is near zero throughout, confirming the handoff is specific to the newline token.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
