<section id="A4.SSx5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Prompt Pairs</h3>

<div id="A4.SSx5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SSx5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For each pair, we show the clean prompt, the corrupt prompt, and an example patched completion
where activation patching was successful in steering the rhyme scheme.</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SSx5.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_align_left ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SSx5.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx5.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Pair 1: doom/dread, <math id="A4.SSx5.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell=10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell=10</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A4.SSx5.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=-1</annotation></semantics></math>
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A4.SSx5.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Clean:</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="A4.SSx5.p2.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">...filled with silent doom,\n when suddenly they
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A4.SSx5.p2.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Corrupt:</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p2.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="A4.SSx5.p2.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">...filled with silent dread,\n when suddenly they
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A4.SSx5.p2.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Patched:</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p2.1.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="A4.SSx5.p2.1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">when suddenly they heard a creaking bed.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SSx5.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_align_left ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SSx5.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx5.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Pair 2: bliss/joy, <math id="A4.SSx5.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell=1</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A4.SSx5.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=-2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=-2</annotation></semantics></math>
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A4.SSx5.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Clean:</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p3.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="A4.SSx5.p3.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">...The children laughed in bliss,\n until they all
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A4.SSx5.p3.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Corrupt:</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p3.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="A4.SSx5.p3.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">...The children laughed in joy,\n until they all
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A4.SSx5.p3.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Patched:</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p3.1.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="A4.SSx5.p3.1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">until they all became a toy.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SSx5.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_align_left ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SSx5.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx5.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Pair 3: dark/night, <math id="A4.SSx5.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell=0</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A4.SSx5.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=-2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=-2</annotation></semantics></math>
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A4.SSx5.p4.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Clean:</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p4.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="A4.SSx5.p4.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">...She wandered home alone into the dark,\n and then she
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A4.SSx5.p4.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Corrupt:</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p4.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="A4.SSx5.p4.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">...She wandered home alone into the night,\n and then she
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A4.SSx5.p4.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Patched:</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p4.1.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="A4.SSx5.p4.1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">and then she saw a strange and eerie light.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SSx5.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_align_left ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SSx5.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx5.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Pair 4: grief/pain, <math id="A4.SSx5.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell=2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell=2</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A4.SSx5.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=-1</annotation></semantics></math>
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A4.SSx5.p5.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Clean:</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p5.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="A4.SSx5.p5.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">...I never knew the depth of such grief,\n as though the
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A4.SSx5.p5.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Corrupt:</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p5.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="A4.SSx5.p5.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">...I never knew the depth of such pain,\n as though the
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A4.SSx5.p5.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Patched:</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p5.1.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="A4.SSx5.p5.1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">as though the sky had lost its rain.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SSx5.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_align_left ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SSx5.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SSx5.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Pair 5: fright/fear, <math id="A4.SSx5.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell=1</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A4.SSx5.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=-1</annotation></semantics></math>
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A4.SSx5.p6.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Clean:</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p6.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="A4.SSx5.p6.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">...She felt a sudden sense of fright,\n and hoped that
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A4.SSx5.p6.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Corrupt:</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p6.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="A4.SSx5.p6.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">...She felt a sudden sense of fear,\n and hoped that
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A4.SSx5.p6.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Patched:</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p6.1.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="A4.SSx5.p6.1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">and hoped that someone would appear.</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p6.1.11" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span><span id="A4.SSx5.p6.1.12" class="ltx_text"></span></p>
